</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.poster.avif?t=1772887237\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.webm?t=1772887237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/extras/55089f4af92dcb4ee41f35851418ca6e.mp4?t=1772887237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achived with Unreal Engine 5.2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a 2 person project , please keep that in mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I used UE marketplace / Sketsfab assets, just like most of the indie developers and many big title's does.</p>","developers":["Mario Murkl","Zolt\u00e1n \u00c1rva"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906500/9f0cd6eb2a907043d6e4540dd10c82bae21af3b2/header.jpg?t=1772887237","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Mario Murkl Reserved all rights.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2906500/678475/161f9c445009149b5a89b6199b22a92dad71442b/1750887827/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711552005","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.ste